# tools/verify/sizes.reasons: the functions over the size limits, and why
# each is kept whole. One line each: FILE:FUNCTION MEASURE VALUE REASON.
# The value is the ceiling the function may not grow past; the checker
# (tools/verify/sizecheck.c) fails on a function past its ceiling and on an
# entry whose function is back within the limit, so the file only shrinks.
# The limits are 100 lines, 6 parameters, nesting 4, complexity 25.

